{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1000_p", "source_sha256": "214d523514d2288799256a2cf9f93c297f798ed0b5dd87c8594392cb061e9413", "ja": "（恵美のPV撮影、ちょっとNGが続いてしまって\nいる。本人も、かなり悩んでいるみたいだ……）", "zh": "（惠美的PV拍摄接连出现了几次NG。\n看起来她本人也相当苦恼……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "b38902406401040e2f0c84be7eb8a6a0909cdcb43224ba0e7ed3975cf0e9c998", "ja": "うーっ……{$P$}、ごめんね。\n撮影、長引いちゃって……。", "zh": "呜……{$P$}，对不起。\n拍摄拖得有点久了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "4269d9496b5ff92288484fbd0b7de31bb83e8ae3a1561c14f3bb25fdd6627567", "ja": "休憩の間に、キャラクターの気持ちは作れたと思う！\n次は、いい感じにできると思うんだけど……。", "zh": "我觉得在休息的时候，已经酝酿好角色的感情了！\n接下来应该能演得不错，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f9ad8929b3ca645b73026a830ed68a1da604087aa39dc665ced9a27fa4ea0c43", "ja": "うーん……でもその様子だと、\nまだ色々、納得いってないんじゃないか？　演出とか。", "zh": "嗯……不过看你这样子，应该还有很多地方没法接受吧？比如演出什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "57d2d7c1b79768805b39c42c7549ddbae2543a6e0b902b7a4717a00a825273ff", "ja": "そ、そんなことないって！\n台本も、演出も、すっごくいいと思ってるよ？", "zh": "才、才不是那样呢！\n我觉得剧本和演出都特别棒啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "279ae1d012676fdb6bfe64f507ef2b7420f6c6a0a6aaedfc55181ea03e137c80", "ja": "ただ……悲しそうに歌う、っていうのが、\nちょっとアタシ的に、しっくりこなくて……。", "zh": "只是……要唱出悲伤的感觉，对我来说总觉得有点不太合适……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1006_p", "source_sha256": "737fd4b0e56ce44488ff8ee2f58cc38ca5e233ddb88093f76ad4f5c1ad8aa87f", "ja": "ふむ……？", "zh": "嗯……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "cee976420e6151164c729e9376dfd390bf404ba15d209048072e2a0f326212da", "ja": "あ、けど大丈夫だからね！　次は、\n悲しい気持ち、ちゃんと出せると思う。任せて！", "zh": "啊，不过没关系的！下次我一定能好好表现出悲伤的感情。交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a60f7e8045027fb13091e828e13c0224ac00724612ddc9f8952e98412bbd4c41", "ja": "いや、でも……引っかかってるのは確かなんだよな？\n監督さんや演出さんと、話した方がいいと思うけど。", "zh": "不，不过……确实还是有点放不下吧？\n我觉得还是应该和导演、演出聊一聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "ef731ea035d15ddf674dd26434f1a310077cdbc6e9ac764cd4a554c7de8462fe", "ja": "ううん、大丈夫。だって、\nいまさら相談しても、撮影が押すだけじゃん？", "zh": "不，没事。因为，\n事到如今就算去商量，也只会让拍摄延期吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9c0c2ab43d47b185c6f7c81cdea948c7f974c24363487cd975a7adf3cac931c5", "ja": "いや……そうなったとしても、ちゃんと相談するべき\nだと思う。これは他でもない、恵美のPVなんだから。", "zh": "不是……就算真变成那样，我也觉得还是应该好好商量一下。毕竟这是惠美的PV。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1012_p", "source_sha256": "143c6dfadf8b746a5ac67acaa59cafbaa8cf0f7543ea416d75d962dcc5e9e078", "ja": "ちなみに恵美は、どんな風に歌いたいと思ったんだ？", "zh": "顺便问一下，惠美想用什么样的方式来唱呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "5a46fde0b584bbbcd4016f862596987179a79e586c3f7a3033575c27f78f646c", "ja": "えっと、上手く言えないけど……これからの希望\nみたいなものを、込めたいって思ったんだよね。", "zh": "那个，我不太会表达……但我想在里面寄托一些对未来的希望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "88009fcc74f99bb1fc076121d85bbad0ba3eb8d80a559161a4685faddac5f21a", "ja": "たしかに、好きな人に「スキ」って言えない\n苦しさは、わかるなーって思うよ？", "zh": "确实，我也能理解那种没法对喜欢的人说出“喜欢”的痛苦呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "aa7ca8928386edfc2ab076f999825d6d8610ad365c1fc5ec2c24eab4ae9487f3", "ja": "でも、いつかは伝えられるようになりたいって、\n前向きな気持ちも、あるんじゃないかな～……。", "zh": "不过，你心里应该也有着“总有一天想把这份心意传达出去”的积极想法吧～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1016_p", "source_sha256": "cff4869a9677e0580c8da814eb2120c46aafd4defdc071b65f84e93b5e277f19", "ja": "なるほど……。恵美がそう感じたなら、\nその感覚は、大切にした方がいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "原来如此……既然惠美有这样的感受，\n那就应该好好珍惜这份感觉吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "a3346a890c62c5884518730b67fa2931707f91b5e7fefa13a2fe896105207311", "ja": "そう、だよね……。\nうん、{$P$}の言う通りかも。", "zh": "是啊，说得对……  \n嗯，也许正如{$P$}所说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "4858e043366017bf4d5bb9c12a471c8c6f6cb7d9349a3033c88fe8351e9e6317", "ja": "これはアタシのPVなんだし、自分が感じたこと、\nちゃんと伝えないと、ダメだよね。", "zh": "这是我的PV，所以我得把自己的感受好好传达出来才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a76604fc37a5a9f3223ec17d46773a4985df562419127201c10d4713b36c9813", "ja": "ああ、ちゃんと話し合って進めていこう。\n恵美にとって、納得のいくPVになるように。", "zh": "嗯，我们好好商量着推进吧。\n争取做出让惠美满意的PV。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "feaa552d13a3cc3e3ee3e0143daa3b4cf262789173932cec01a88b059d0f3e96", "ja": "うん！　ありがとね、話聞いてくれて。\n……アタシ、また臆病になっちゃうとこだったかも。", "zh": "嗯！谢谢你愿意听我说。\n……我刚才差点又变得胆小了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b12c80ae7277f949ec71894d746cc23536e769b1948c5dd02e4c9a8e9e987ce2", "ja": "ん？　何か言った？", "zh": "嗯？你刚才说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0274_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "d551d371da59d57fc2e8377514718611148d97520c8a3a96b6fab422674d2fbe", "ja": "えっ、あ、ううん！　何でもない！\nんじゃ、スタッフさん達と話してくるね！　にゃはは♪", "zh": "欸？啊，没、没什么！什么都没有！\n那我去和工作人员们聊聊！呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
